        {"zh": "我又蹦又跳地出现", "en": "I appear in a flurry of hops"},
        {"zh": "我的影子先落在石头上", "en": "My shadow lands on the stone"},
        {"zh": "远处传来一声尖响", "en": "A sharp cry comes from far off"}
